{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"a2c6691baf9c7bfc","name":"card_unit_47th_infantry_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/USA/Breakthrough/units/card_unit_47th_infantry_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"47th INFANTRY REGIMENT","text":"Becomes Veteran at the start of your turn if you have 13 or more kredit slots.","flavorText":"The 47th Infantry Regiment of the US Army was first formed in 1917 and fought in WWI. The regiment was disbanded in 1921 but reformed in 1940. In 1942 the regiment landed in French Morocco where it fought the Vichy French forces during Operation Blackstone. The regiment fought with the 9th Division in the Battle of El Guettar and the Battle of Sedjenane during the Tunisian Campaign. In 1943 the division was then sent to Sicily where it fought in the Battle of Troina. The regiment landed with the 9th Division in Normandy 4 days after D-Day and would from then on fight in numerous battles, including the Battle of Cherbourg and the Battle of the Bulge, and finally fighting German resistance in the Harz Mountains in Germany. After the German surrender the regiment conducted occupation duty in Germany until 1946.","faction":"USA","type":"infantry","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":8,"operationCost":2,"attack":4,"defense":4},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_47th_infantry_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_47th_infantry_regiment_title","SourceString":"47th INFANTRY REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"47th INFANTRY REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":4,"defense":4,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::USA","kredits":8,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_47th_infantry_regiment_text","SourceString":"Becomes Veteran at the start of your turn if you have 13 or more kredit slots.","LocalizedString":"Becomes Veteran at the start of your turn if you have 13 or more kredit slots."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_47th_infantry_regiment_history","SourceString":"The 47th Infantry Regiment of the US Army was first formed in 1917 and fought in WWI. The regiment was disbanded in 1921 but reformed in 1940. In 1942 the regiment landed in French Morocco where it fought the Vichy French forces during Operation Blackstone. The regiment fought with the 9th Division in the Battle of El Guettar and the Battle of Sedjenane during the Tunisian Campaign. In 1943 the division was then sent to Sicily where it fought in the Battle of Troina. The regiment landed with the 9th Division in Normandy 4 days after D-Day and would from then on fight in numerous battles, including the Battle of Cherbourg and the Battle of the Bulge, and finally fighting German resistance in the Harz Mountains in Germany. After the German surrender the regiment conducted occupation duty in Germany until 1946.","LocalizedString":"The 47th Infantry Regiment of the US Army was first formed in 1917 and fought in WWI. The regiment was disbanded in 1921 but reformed in 1940. In 1942 the regiment landed in French Morocco where it fought the Vichy French forces during Operation Blackstone. The regiment fought with the 9th Division in the Battle of El Guettar and the Battle of Sedjenane during the Tunisian Campaign. In 1943 the division was then sent to Sicily where it fought in the Battle of Troina. The regiment landed with the 9th Division in Normandy 4 days after D-Day and would from then on fight in numerous battles, including the Battle of Cherbourg and the Battle of the Bulge, and finally fighting German resistance in the Harz Mountains in Germany. After the German surrender the regiment conducted occupation duty in Germany until 1946."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Breakthrough","isReserved":true,"showBoostIcon":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger","EHelpBubbleTypes::Veteran","EHelpBu